sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant Controller as odh-model-controller<br/>controller-runtime
    participant MSA as model-serving-api<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>Scrapes 8080/TCP
    participant OTEL as OpenTelemetry Collector<br/>OTLP/gRPC TLS

    Note over User,OTEL: Admission Request Flow
    User->>K8sAPI: Create/Update InferenceService
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-serving-kserve-io-v1beta1-inferenceservice<br/>443→9443/TCP TLS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated resource (FailurePolicy=Fail)
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-serving-kserve-io-v1beta1-inferenceservice<br/>443→9443/TCP TLS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission decision
    K8sAPI-->>User: Resource created/rejected

    Note over User,OTEL: Controller Reconciliation Flow
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event (resource changed)<br/>ServiceAccount token, TLS
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Get ServingRuntime<br/>TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: ServingRuntime spec
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Service<br/>TLS 1.2+
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Route<br/>TLS 1.2+
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update NetworkPolicy<br/>TLS 1.2+
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ServiceAccount<br/>TLS 1.2+
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update PodMonitor<br/>TLS 1.2+
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ClusterRoleBinding<br/>TLS 1.2+

    Note over User,OTEL: Gateway Discovery Flow
    User->>MSA: GET /api/v1/gateways<br/>443→8443/TCP TLS<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    MSA->>K8sAPI: SelfSubjectAccessReview<br/>TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>MSA: Authorization decision
    MSA->>K8sAPI: List Gateways (label selector)<br/>TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>MSA: Gateway list
    MSA-->>User: JSON gateway response

    Note over User,OTEL: LLM-D Samples Flow (unauthenticated)
    User->>MSA: GET /api/v1/samples/llm-d<br/>443→8443/TCP TLS
    MSA-->>User: Static YAML templates

    Note over User,OTEL: Observability Flow
    Prom->>Controller: GET /metrics<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    Controller-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
    Prom->>MSA: GET /metrics<br/>8080/TCP TLS
    MSA-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
    MSA->>OTEL: OTLP traces<br/>gRPC TLS (when configured)
